<title>USA: Aviall sees early repayment of note due in 2002.</title>
<headline>Aviall sees early repayment of note due in 2002.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aviall Inc Thursday said it has been informed that a $12 million subordinated note not due until 2002 will be repaid &quot;within the week.&quot;</p>
<p>The note has a stated interest rate of 12 percent, and was received in connection with the asset sale of Aviall's business aviation engine repair operation completed in March 1995.</p>
<p>Proceeds from an early repayment of the note will be used to reduce the bank debt of the company, it said.</p>
</text>
